<Section Class="p-0" Size="HeadingSize.H4" Name="Common Methods" PageUrl="@pageUrl" Link="common-methods">
    <Block>
        Every chart inherits these methods from <code>ChartComponentBase</code>. The chart's own versions of <code>AddDataAsync</code>, <code>AddDatasetAsync</code>, <code>InitializeAsync</code> and <code>UpdateAsync</code> are listed under <strong>Methods</strong> above.
        <code>HandleClickAsync</code>, <code>HandleHoverAsync</code> and <code>HandleLegendClickAsync</code> are called by the browser to raise <code>OnClick</code>, <code>OnHover</code> and <code>OnLegendClick</code>; you don't call them yourself.
    </Block>
    <DocxTable TItem="ChartComponentBase" DocType="DocType.Methods" />
</Section>

